Version: 0.0.1

A full-screen terminal client for ACP coding agents. A new unnamed interactive s
tart asks which agent to use for this invocation; explicit commands, headless an
d resume routes keep their existing behavior.

Options:
  -h, --help                       Show this help.
  -V, --version                    Show the version number for this program.
      --agent-command=<command>    Start this ACP agent command instead of chord
's own; [agent] only names it.

Commands:
  agents  List the agents chord can start: name, title, command, and for those s
tarted by their own CLI whether PATH has it.

Examples:
  Claude Code                   chord claude
  An agent chord does not know  chord my-agent --agent-command "my-agent --acp"

  error: Unknown option "--resume".


